  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Racial Disgust",
  "description": "The concept of 'racial disgust' refers to the visceral, often irrational, revulsion directed at Black people based on their race. This is a core component of systemic racism and is used to justify exclusion, violence, or contempt. The meme's text 'the definition of utter disgust' directly invokes this concept, implying that the Black man is inherently repulsive — a racist assertion that relies on the viewer's internalized racial biases.",
